Z||000000||Cheever3000||09-17-2001||11:42 PM||||I don't know if I wanted a distraction from the talking heads on the box, or an inspiration as the world heats up, but I was at the video store, and picked up Red Dawn.  I saw it back when it first came out, but had forgotten most of it.  It was kinda cheesy, that's all I remembered.  But I enjoyed it more this time than I did before.  Maybe because of all the actors who got better roles later.  Anyway, it was a pretty good couple of hours eating the rest of the junk food in the house.<P>It's probably been discussed here before, and maybe some people would say this is not the time to think about it, but then again I went to see The Big Chill after my best friend's funeral.<P>So, what war movies do you recommend from the video store?<BR>||||reg||4
